OL,3,APolice and army mourn officer killed in
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of the public also gathered for
OL,7,Fthe funeral at Kirkleatham Walled
OL,8,FGardens, in Redcar, along with family,
OL,9,Ffriends and former colleagues from
OL,10,FBritish Transport Police and the Civil
OL,11,FNuclear Constabulary in Sellafield,
OL,12,FCumbria.
OL,14,FCleveland Police Federation chair
OL,15,FLauren Somerville said PC Clough's
OL,16,Fpartner said public support "brought
OL,17,Fthem so much strength".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
